WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.923
Going to the park is lots of fun.

2
00:00:09.924 --> 00:00:16.102
There is so much to do!

3
00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:18.784
Hana: Can I help you?

4
00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:21.869
Mom: Can you take the paper cups over there?

5
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:24.699
Hana: Are we going on a picnic?

6
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:31.996
Sunny: Yes, we're going to Golden Gate Park.

7
00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:34.509
Tom: What do you want to do first?

8
00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.816
Bada: Can we rollerblade?

9
00:00:36.817 --> 00:00:43.057
Sunny: Sure! Let's go rent some skates!

10
00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:45.251
Hana: Watch this!

11
00:00:45.252 --> 00:00:49.897
Bada: Mom! Can you take a picture of us, please?

12
00:00:49.898 --> 00:00:54.091
Mom: Okay, everyone, say, "Cheese!"

13
00:00:54.092 --> 00:00:58.901
Hana, Bada, Tom & Sunny: CHEESE!

14
00:00:58.902 --> 00:01:01.461
Tom: Let's go for a boat ride.

15
00:01:01.462 --> 00:01:03.832
Bada: I can see fish!

16
00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.681
Mom: Hold still, Hana.

17
00:01:05.682 --> 00:01:08.211
I'm going to take a picture.

18
00:01:08.212 --> 00:01:13.884
Hana: Oh, the bird flew away!

19
00:01:13.885 --> 00:01:15.875
Mom: What's over there?

20
00:01:15.876 --> 00:01:19.338
Tom: That's Queen Wilhelmina's Garden and Windmill.

21
00:01:19.339 --> 00:01:21.519
Mom: It's beautiful.

22
00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:27.787
Hana: Look at the tulips, Mom!

23
00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:32.374
Sunny: Excuse me, can you take a picture of us, please?

24
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:34.088
Man: No problem!

25
00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:37.898
Okay, everybody, say, "Cheese!"

26
00:01:37.899 --> 00:01:41.994
Everyone: CHEESE!

27
00:01:41.995 --> 00:01:45.675
We took many photographs at the park.

28
00:01:45.676 --> 00:01:53.966
Do you want to see my favorite one?
